OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thu 20 Aug to Sat 29 Aug
OL,6,FThe first few days of this period are
OL,7,Flikely to be rather changeable, with
OL,8,Fmany parts of the UK seeing showers or
OL,9,Fperhaps some longer spells of rain.
OL,10,FThereafter, high pressure becomes
OL,11,Fincreasingly probable over the north
OL,12,Fand west, with low pressure to the
OL,13,Fsouth of the UK. This will lead to
OL,14,Ffurther spells of showers and longer
OL,15,Fspells of rain, but the north may see
OL,16,Fmore in the way of drier conditions.
OL,17,FWithin this broad pattern, there is
OL,18,Fpotential for Atlantic lows to spread
OL,19,Facross the UK at times, which would
OL,20,Fbring more widespread rain and perhaps
OL,21,Fstrong winds. Temperatures are more
OL,22,Flikely to be above normal than below
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,23,Foverall, though the possibility of
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
OL,24,Fwidespread or exceptional heat is
OL,25,Fperhaps a little lower than in recent
OL,26,Fweeks.
